{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04403","headline":"感遇诗三十八首 二十九 · 陈子昂","name":"感遇诗三十八首 二十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丁亥岁云暮，西山事甲兵。\n赢粮匝邛道，荷戟争羗城。\n严冬阴风劲，穷岫泄云生。\n昏噎无昼夜，羽檄复相惊。\n拳局竞万仞，崩危走九冥。\n籍籍峰壑里，哀哀冰雪行。\n圣人御宇宙，闻道泰阶平。\n肉食谋何失，藜藿缅纵横。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04403.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04403","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}